            <ArticleTitle>The management of renal colic.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>179-85</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Renal colic can be a challenging cause of abdominal pain in the military population. This review highlights the management of renal colic in the Royal Navy's operational setting. It provides an overview of the diagnosis, treatment options and occupational health issues in the deployed (Role 1) and hospital environments (Role 2 and 3).</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
